From: Paul Nel <paul@fashionpass.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:37:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] adbroot: Start adbd rooted when enabled

Apply the default or persisted Lineage rooted-debugging policy during service initialization so a fresh userdebug boot does not require a manual adb root command.

Generated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)

Co-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Change-Id: I0cb4d5dfda080fa8052ccbb8010a52d298b905ad
---
 root/adbroot_service.cpp | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/root/adbroot_service.cpp b/root/adbroot_service.cpp
index 9c2da90a..faa4e273 100644
--- a/root/adbroot_service.cpp
+++ b/root/adbroot_service.cpp
@@ -87,6 +87,11 @@ ADBRootService::ADBRootService() : enabled_(true) {
     if (ReadFileToString(kStoragePath + kEnabled, &buf)) {
         enabled_ = Trim(buf) == "1";
     }
+
+    if (enabled_) {
+        SetProperty("service.adb.root", "1");
+        SetProperty("ctl.restart", "adbd");
+    }
 }
 
 void ADBRootService::Register() {
